228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (They consider spatial dependency and temporal dependency at the same time by combining spatial graph convolutions with temporal models such as RNNs or CNNs to capture temporal dependencies along with spatial graph relations.)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
