/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 544 0 R
/E (This adaptive weighting allows AGNNs to focus more on influential nodes or edges that contribute significantly to the detection task.)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 545 0 R
/E (AGNNs naturally handle the heterogeneity and complexity inherent in social networks and fake news propagation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
